n and worshiped.}{\f25\fs20\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 \par }\pard \ql \li1080\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin1080\itap0\pararsid742525 {\f25\fs20\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 \par }\pard \ql \li1440\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin1440\itap0\pararsid742525 {\b\f25\fs20\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 d. Sacrifice in New Covenant: \par }{\f25\fs20\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 \par {\pntext\pard\plain\f3\fs20\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 \loch\af3\dbch\af0\hich\f3 \u-3913\'b7\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li2160\ri0\nowidctlpar\jclisttab\tx2160{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls13\pnrnot0\pnf3\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp120\pnhang{\pntxtb \'b7}}\faauto\ls13\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0\pararsid742525 {\b\f25\fs20\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 Christ is the Sacrificial lamb of God\par }\pard \ql \li2160\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin2160\itap0\pararsid742525 {\b\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 Heb. 9:26}{\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525  for then he would have had to suffer again and again since the foundation of the world. But as it is, he has appeared once for all at the end of the age to remove sin by the}{\b\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525  sacrifice}{\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525  of himself. \par }{\b\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 Heb. 10:12}{\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525  But when Christ had offered for all time a single}{\b\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525  sacrifice}{\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525  for sins, \ldblquote he sat down at the right hand of God,\rdblquote \par }{\b\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 1John 4:10}{\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525  In this is love, not that we loved God but that he loved us and sent his Son to be the atoning}{\b\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525  sacrifice}{\f25\fs20\cf1\insrsid742525\charrsid742525  for our sins.}{\f25\fs20\insrsid742525\charrsid742525 \par }\pard \ql \li1080\r